inite-words-and-languages</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists Z_0\\,\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\land\n0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^*)\\land\nq_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in\\Gamma\\land F\\subseteq Q\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists Z_0\\,\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\land\n0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^*)\\land\nq_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in\\Gamma\\land F\\subseteq Q\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{PDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{PDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A move consumes either one input symbol or none, pops one stack symbol, and pushes a finite word over the stack alphabet.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (input alphabet, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}$ (finite powerset, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists Z_0\\,\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\land\n0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\land\n\\delta:Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma^*)\\land\nq_0\\in Q\\land Z_0\\in\\Gamma\\land F\\subseteq Q\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{PDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1348,"backlinks":[{"id":"f6aea2e756d32c1b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\G